# lw-core

**Phase:** Core  
**Dependencies:** lw-db, lw-shared  
**Dependency of:** every resource above Foundation

Player session management, lifecycle events, character loading, server-side cache, and routing bucket management. lw-core is an API and data layer — it owns the session lifecycle and exposes primitives. It does not know about characters, organizations, money, inventory, or any gameplay concept.

## Database

Creates one table: `lw_players` (`license2`, `name`, `group`, `created_at`, `last_seen`).

State IDs live in `lw_characters`, owned by `lw-characters-api`. On restart, lw-core detects prefix changes and migrates existing state IDs automatically via a cascading transaction.

## Session object

The in-memory session object available via exports:

```lua
{
    source   = integer,  -- current FiveM source ID
    license2 = string,   -- bare identifier, immutable for session lifetime
    name     = string,   -- GetPlayerName, updated on connect if changed
    group    = string,   -- server ACE group
    stateId  = string?,  -- active character state ID, nil until set
    bucket   = any?,     -- current routing bucket key, nil if default world
}
```

## State IDs

The canonical cross-resource character identifier. Format: `CONFIG_PREFIX` (2–4 uppercase chars) + 13 random uppercase alphanumeric chars.

To generate a state ID at the end of character creation:

```lua
-- Must be inside a Citizen.CreateThread
local stateId = exports['lw-core']:RequestStateId()
-- Insert stateId into lw_characters via lw-characters-api, then call SetActiveCharacter
```

lw-core generates and validates uniqueness. `lw-characters-api` owns the insert.

## ACE setup

Add to `server.cfg` before any `ensure` statements:

```
add_principal group.lw.mod        group.lw.user
add_principal group.lw.admin      group.lw.mod
add_principal group.lw.dev        group.lw.admin
add_principal group.lw.superadmin group.lw.dev

add_ace resource.lw-core command.add_ace          allow
add_ace resource.lw-core command.remove_ace       allow
add_ace resource.lw-core command.add_principal    allow
add_ace resource.lw-core command.remove_principal allow
```

## Config

| Key | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `StateIdPrefix` | string | 2–4 uppercase letters prepended to every state ID. Set before first boot — cannot be changed after characters exist |
| `StateIdCharset` | string | Characters used for the random portion |
| `StateIdRandomLength` | number | Length of random portion (default 13) |
| `DefaultGroup` | string | ACE group for players not in `PlayerGroups` |
| `Groups` | table | All valid server groups |
| `PlayerGroups` | table | Maps `license2:xxxx` to a specific group |
| `SaveInterval` | number | Minutes between `last_seen` heartbeats |
| `PermissionTimeout` | number | Ms before permission collection falls back |

