## Server exports

### Session reads

```lua
exports['lw-core']:GetPlayer(source)              -- session table or nil
exports['lw-core']:GetPlayerByLicense2(license2)  -- session table or nil
exports['lw-core']:GetAllPlayers()                -- all active sessions keyed by source
exports['lw-core']:GetPlayerCount()               -- integer
exports['lw-core']:GetOfflinePlayer(license2)     -- lw_players row or nil (sync, requires thread)
```

### Session writes

```lua
exports['lw-core']:SetActiveCharacter(source, stateId)  -- returns boolean
exports['lw-core']:ClearActiveCharacter(source)         -- returns boolean
exports['lw-core']:Logout(source)                       -- clears character, returns to selection
```

### State IDs

```lua
exports['lw-core']:RequestStateId()  -- sync, requires Citizen.CreateThread
```

### Routing buckets

```lua
exports['lw-core']:RegisterBucket(key, owner)    -- returns bucketId or nil
exports['lw-core']:DeregisterBucket(key, owner)  -- evicts players to bucket 0, returns boolean
exports['lw-core']:AssignPlayer(source, key)     -- returns boolean
exports['lw-core']:RemovePlayer(source)          -- returns player to bucket 0, returns boolean
```

### Permissions

```lua
-- Register on resource start
exports['lw-core']:RegisterPermissions(resourceName, perms)

-- Register if this resource contributes roles on character selection
exports['lw-core']:RegisterPermissionContributor(resourceName)

-- Called after lw-core:characterSelected fires
exports['lw-core']:GrantRoles(source, roles)
exports['lw-core']:DoneContributing(source, resourceName)

exports['lw-core']:HasAcePermission(source, permission)  -- boolean
exports['lw-core']:IsPlayerAdmin(source)                 -- boolean
```

### Identifiers

```lua
exports['lw-core']:GetIdentifier(source, type)   -- bare string or nil
exports['lw-core']:GetAllIdentifiers(source)     -- table of all identifiers
-- Valid types: 'license', 'license2', 'steam', 'discord', 'ip'
```

### Callbacks

```lua
-- Server: register a named handler
exports['lw-core']:RegisterCallback('myresource:name', function(source, resolve, ...)
    resolve(returnValue)
end)
```

## Client exports

```lua
exports['lw-core']:TriggerServerCallback(name, cb, ...)  -- fires cb with server response
exports['lw-core']:GetSessionData()                      -- { license2, name, group } or nil
```

